<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black">Dear&nbsp;</span><span style="background-color: yellow; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">[Insert Name]</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">,</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><br></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri">The American Red Cross
would like to invite you and your fellow firefighters, police officers and
other </span><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">emergency
personnel</span><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri"> to host a Battle of the
Badges blood drive. </span><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;
font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri"><br></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Battle of the Badges builds camaraderie among local first
responders though a friendly competition to see who can collect the most units
of blood.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp;</span>It’s a great way for friends,
family, and emergency personnel come to together to donate blood and help save
lives with the Red Cross. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><br></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Every two seconds someone in U.S. needs blood. Blood
donations can make a positive, life changing difference for someone in need.
That is why your help is needed more than ever!<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><br></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Supporting the Red Cross is another great way to touch
lives in the communities you serve every day. Please take the lifesaving
challenge and call me at your earliest convenience to schedule your blood
drive. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><br></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Thank you, <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><br></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;background:
yellow">[Insert Name]</span><o:p></o:p></p><br></p>]]></td>
